  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Sheep?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/cc/Sheep.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025203649\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Sheep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sheep\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Sheep</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 16 • 26 • 42</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 800 • 2,300 • 3,800</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gives </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Wool</span><span title=\"Wool\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/wool-2270\" title=\"Wool\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wool\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/34/Wool.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20191025193439\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  every 6 h</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Sheep</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a> <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a> that produce <a href=\"/wiki/wool-2270\" title=\"Wool\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">wool</a>. They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 16. They are the fourth type of farm animal unlocked in the game. Baby sheep are called <a href=\"/wiki/lamb-36739\" title=\"Lamb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lambs</a>, which are later unlocked in Level 25.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ASheep.png\" title=\"Sheep.png (137 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/cc/Sheep.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025203649\" title=\"Sheep.png (137 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sheep\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Sheep.png (137 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sheep\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Sheep</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASheep_Walking.png\" title=\"Sheep Walking.png (136 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/8c/Sheep_Walking.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025203706\" title=\"Sheep Walking.png (136 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Sheep Walking.png (136 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASheep_Full.png\" title=\"Sheep Full.png (186 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/74/Sheep_Full.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025203637\" title=\"Sheep Full.png (186 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sheep Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Sheep Full.png (186 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sheep Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Sheep Full</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASheep_Hungry.png\" title=\"Sheep Hungry.png (116 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/88/Sheep_Hungry.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025203642\" title=\"Sheep Hungry.png (116 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sheep Hungry\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Sheep Hungry.png (116 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sheep Hungry\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Sheep Hungry</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASheep_Summer.png\" title=\"Sheep Summer.png (188 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/18/Sheep_Summer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/145?cb=20260610011612\" title=\"Sheep Summer.png (188 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sheep Summer\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Sheep Summer.png (188 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sheep Summer\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Sheep Summer</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASheep_Summer_Full.png\" title=\"Sheep Summer Full.png (68 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b9/Sheep_Summer_Full.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/172?cb=20141026161329\" title=\"Sheep Summer Full.png (68 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sheep Summer Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Sheep Summer Full.png (68 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sheep Summer Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Sheep Summer Full</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASheep_Winter.png\" title=\"Sheep Winter.png (392 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3a/Sheep_Winter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/130?cb=20260516225429\" title=\"Sheep Winter.png (392 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sheep Winter\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Sheep Winter.png (392 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sheep Winter\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Sheep Winter</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASheep_Halloween.png\" title=\"Sheep Halloween.png (92 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/22/Sheep_Halloween.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/182?cb=20141028102135\" title=\"Sheep Halloween.png (92 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sheep Halloween\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Sheep Halloween.png (92 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sheep Halloween\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Sheep Halloween</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASheep_Halloween_Full.png\" title=\"Sheep Halloween Full.png (61 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f3/Sheep_Halloween_Full.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20141026155613\" title=\"Sheep Halloween Full.png (61 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sheep Halloween Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Sheep Halloween Full.png (61 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sheep Halloween Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Sheep Halloween Full</div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Alternate appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/themes-25920\" title=\"Themes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Themes</a></i>\n</p><p>Sheep wear themed clothes and accessories during summer, Halloween and winter.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e0/Sheep_Pasture.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713111444\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A sheep pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A sheep pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A sheep pasture</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Sheep must be placed in <a href=\"/wiki/sheep-pasture-2721\" title=\"Sheep Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sheep pastures</a> to be purchased. Pastures cost 300 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each. They are unlocked at levels 16, 26 and 42. Each pasture can house five sheep.\n</p><p>At level 16 sheep cost 800 coins each; at level 26 2,300 coins; at level 42 3,800 coins.\n</p><p>Sheep and sheep pastures can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a>.<span>Shop</span><span title=\"Shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a3/Sheep_Shears.png/revision/latest?cb=20260513194130\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Shears\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shears\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"117\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Shears</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Wool can be sheared from sheep every 6 hours. Players can skip the wait by paying 8 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a> per sheep. Players must then give sheep <a href=\"/wiki/sheep-feed-2087\" title=\"Sheep Feed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sheep feed</a> to get another harvest.\n</p><p>Sheep feed is made of:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/soybean-2079\" title=\"Soybean\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Soybean\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/wheat-2062\" title=\"Wheat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wheat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>It takes 30 minutes to make 3 units of <a href=\"/wiki/sheep-feed-2087\" title=\"Sheep Feed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sheep feed</a>. You can easily collect all your wool and replenish your feed stock by the time the sheep are ready to be sheared again.</li>\n<li>Wool can pretty regularly be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a>.</li>\n<li>Feeding farm animals and harvesting wool are common tasks in <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derbies</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Easter egg</b></span></h3>\n<p>Tapping the sheep pasture or making a rock explode scares the sheep, making them run from the perceived danger. In other circumstances sheep look nervous and easily frightened. This somewhat mimics their behavior in real life: sheep are quick to flee and panic, and are sensitive to noise.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Did you know?</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Where you tap hungry sheep, they turn into their full appearance. This only happens when you don’t have enough food to feed them. It lasts about 3 seconds.</li>\n<li>The ghost costume sheep wear during Halloween is alike <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://disney.fandom.com/wiki/Jacob_Marley\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Jacob Marley's</a> in the Disney adaptation of Dickens's <i>A Christmas Carol</i>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/chicken-2409\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a3/Chicken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025192121\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/cow-2488\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/84/Cow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025194659\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/duck-16989\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Duck.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713101647\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Sockeye_Salmon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150711153706\" title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" class=\"thumbima